  "deployment_rule": "Patterns are reusable hypotheses and software/control test templates only. A target does not inherit Boeing/Spirit readiness or evidence. Each target requires its own source/requirements map, security/data boundary, partner-authorized evidence, pilot, measured effect and independent review before any 98.7 contact gate can close.",
